This distribution continues the community-maintained flutter-tflite
repository:
https://github.com/dropout/flutter-tflite

That repository is based on TensorFlow's flutter-tflite project:
https://github.com/tensorflow/flutter-tflite

TensorFlow's project is itself a managed fork of Amish Garg's original
tflite_flutter_plugin project:
https://github.com/am15h/tflite_flutter_plugin

The original authors and contributors remain credited in AUTHORS and the
project history. The software is distributed under the Apache License,
Version 2.0, included in LICENSE.

The maintained derivative changes the published package identity, project
metadata, documentation, repository links, and maintenance infrastructure.
